+Generation is inverse.  Starting from sorted sizes, it composes a random,
+reduced word containing a prescribed mixture of breakpoint-creating and
+breakpoint-preserving flips.  Reversing that word is therefore a known sorting
+certificate; no generated instance is solved in order to obtain its answer.
