+    "would leave only toy formulas.  Instead, inverse generation starts at the "
+    "identity and samples each hidden flip uniformly from all currently eligible "
+    "moves of its scheduled breakpoint-change type.  The schedule mixes +1 and "
+    "0 changes, so reversing it is a bounded certificate but the all-efficient "
