Implemented a native Track A generator, grounded in Section 2 and Theorem 19 of [*Pancake Flipping Is Hard*](https://arxiv.org/abs/1111.0434).

Files:

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1111.0434/gen_1111_0434.py)
